WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.680
How do you know God loves you

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.720
when life hurts?

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.320
Romans five points us to Christ,

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.300
who died for us while we were

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.140
still sinners.

6
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.860
God moved toward us when we couldn’t

7
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:14.920
make ourselves right.

8
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.180
He reconciled us to himself.

9
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.720
And Paul says we now rejoice

10
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.520
in God through Jesus Christ.

11
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.160
His gift is a restored relationship

12
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.820
with him.

13
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.180
You can know him,

14
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.280
trust him,

15
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.620
and rejoice in him.

16
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.880
Romans eight says suffering can’t separate those

17
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.180
in Christ from his love.

18
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.540
You can bring him your grief without

19
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:36.820
pretending it doesn’t hurt.

20
00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.940
When you wonder whether you’re loved,

21
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.640
look again at Jesus.

22
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.120
Trust the God who gave his Son

23
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.740
and brings you near to himself.
